msgid ""
"`a bug tracker <https://bugs.galette.eu/projects/galette/>`_, to declare "
"issues or to ask for evolutions,"
msgstr ""
"`sledilnik hroščev <https://bugs.galette.eu/projects/galette/>`_, za prijavo "
"težav ali zahtevo po izboljšavah,"

#: ../index.rst:52
msgid ""
"`a wonderful :p documentation <https://doc.galette.eu>`_, you are currently "
"reading,"
msgstr ""
"`čudovita :p dokumentacija <https://doc.galette.eu>`_, trenutno berete,"

#: ../index.rst:53
msgid ""
"`a voting system <https://vote.galette.eu>`_, you can vote for features,"
msgstr ""
"`glasovalni sistem <https://vote.galette.eu>`_, lahko glasujete za funkcije,"

