msgid ""
"`a Telemetry application <https://telemetry.galette.eu>`_ which handles and "
"displays Telemetry data received from volunteer Galette instances."
msgstr ""
"`aplikacija za telemetrijo <https://telemetry.galette.eu>`_, ki obravnava in "
"prikazuje podatke o telemetriji, prejete od prostovoljnih primerkov Galette."

